3-vtRyu_yAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8WAHc-PbqwKSWFM--lBg1OL7wHyKHM080_nmZXND3Tw&oe=6B09C6F2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "REEL_cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3350658941789099", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/753032404_3350658945122432_9204743909055786045_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8kS2kHSoADwQ7kNvwHvTzlE&_nc_oc=AdqpsQSrejBFu6k4lMjF9ObwoF3SjZNaKnF6A_suh7TCIuRZRyaPV7qWCLhkDyYqwLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSynAN_JKKHBbhUbRz581-GSqvA9ECTE_irj7XZR9TArw&oe=6B09CAAB"}, "display_name": "Reel", "keywords": ["fish", "fishing", "pets", "multiplayer", "adventure"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfa3 **Catch crazy fish, ride creature boats and take on giant bosses with your friends,!**\n\nGrab your rod, jump on your boat and see what's biting!\n\n### \ud83d\udc1f Creatures that fight\nWhen the fish rests, **REEL IT IN!** When it fights, **SLOW DOWN!** Don't let it get away!\n{1143335128070810}\n\n### \ud83c\udf1f Catch them all\nEvery water has its own fish, from teeny tiny to crazy monsters. Fill your booklet and show off your biggest catch!\n{1045757075166259}\n\n### \ud83e\udd80 GIANT catches\nTeam up with your lobby to battle huge bosses. Hook their weak spots, knock off their armor and reel them in together!\n{1525474496015407}\n\n### \ud83c\udf0a Explore new waters\nSail to the 25 different areas in the world. \n{1131884519284406}\n\n### \u2728 Epic rods\nLevel up from a simple pole to rods that sparkle, glow and blaze. Every upgrade unlocks stronger rods that catch bigger fish!\n{918211451148000}\n\n### \ud83d\udc09 Ride creature boats\nSteer creature boats with, make them faster and bring friends aboard. Pick your favorite skin, saddle and reins. On land, your boat shrinks and follows you like a pet!\n{2910363825994606}\n\n**Grab your friends and let's go fishing!** 